# ::tok The report believes that the content ecology of the e-commerce industry is a comprehensive concept, is to integrate e-commerce and content, but not all content can be integrated with e-commerce, good PGC (professionally produced content) and UGC (user-generated content) is a high-quality carrier for integration with e-commerce, the higher the value of the content platform, the richer the consumption and promotion scenarios, the higher the possibility of e-commerce implantation, the stronger the commercial value. The proportion of e-commerce content production and content consumption that is gradually integrated and distributed between the public and private sectors will be higher.
