# ::tok First of all, just bought a few days and found that the price was reduced, bad reviews, this is not bad, cost-effective, CPU and graphics card are enough to cope with mainstream online games and a considerable part of large stand-alone, heat dissipation is very good, but the screen is a little light leakage (the common problem of IPS screen), the audio quality is not very good, the hard disk is not good (it is recommended to spend some money to add a solid state), yesterday took it to the after-sales to test the hardware, there is no problem, The built-in win8.1 is not very easy to use, it is recommended to upgrade to 10, the seller ships quickly, and the answers to various inquiries are also very fast, and the invoice arrives the next day after receiving the computer, not bad, but unfortunately there are no gifts.
